package main

// English versions of the legal and support pages. Keep them in sync with the Turkish texts in compliance.go.

const privacyPolicyHTMLEn = `<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 2026</p>
<h2>1. Data Controller</h2><p>{{CONTACT}}</p>
<h2>2. Data We Process</h2><ul>
<li><strong>Account:</strong> username, password hash, email address if provided, and Google or Apple account ID.</li>
<li><strong>Guest account:</strong> a random device ID generated by the app. No advertising ID is used.</li>
<li><strong>Profile and game:</strong> profile photo or avatar, country choice, XP, coins, cases, statistics, quests and dice collection.</li>
<li><strong>Social data:</strong> friendships, game invites, blocks and reports.</li>
<li><strong>Match chat:</strong> messages are not stored permanently. To review reports, recent messages are kept in memory for up to 30 minutes; if a player is reported, those messages from the reported player are attached to the report.</li>
<li><strong>Friend messages:</strong> can only be sent between friends; they are kept for up to 30 days for delivery and deleted when the account is deleted. If you report a friend, the messages they sent you in the last 7 days are attached to the report.</li>
<li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP addresses are processed for security and rate limiting and may appear temporarily in the hosting provider's system logs.</li></ul>
<h2>3. How We Collect Data, Purposes and Legal Bases</h2><p>Data is collected electronically through the app and website: from the information you enter, from the sign-in provider you choose (Google or Apple), and automatically while you play. We process data to provide your account and the game, run matchmaking and social features, recover passwords, prevent abuse and meet legal obligations. The legal bases are performance of a contract, legitimate interests and, where required, your consent.</p>
<h2>4. Sharing</h2><p>Data is never sold or shared for advertising. It may be shared, only as needed to run the service, with hosting and database providers, the email delivery provider and, depending on how you sign in, Google or Apple. These providers may be located outside your country. Your username, avatar, country and game statistics are visible to other players.</p>
<h2>5. Retention</h2><p>Account data is kept until the account is deleted. Open reports are kept until resolved, and resolved reports for up to 90 days. For closed accounts, records needed to prevent repeated abuse may be kept.</p>
<h2>6. Your Rights</h2><p>Under the GDPR, Türkiye's KVKK and similar laws, you may have the right to access, correct and delete your data, to restrict or object to processing, and to data portability. You can send requests to the contact address below and you may complain to your data protection authority.</p>
<h2>7. Deleting Your Account</h2><p>In the app, use <strong>Customize Profile → Permanently Delete My Account and Data</strong>, or the <a href="/account/delete?lang=en">web account deletion page</a>.</p>
<h2>8. Children</h2><p>Yat Dice is not directed at children under 13 and does not knowingly collect data from them.</p>
<h2>9. Security and Changes</h2><p>Passwords are stored as hashes and connections are encrypted in production. If this policy changes, the new version will be published on this page.</p>
<h2>10. Contact</h2><p>{{CONTACT}}</p>`

const termsOfUseHTMLEn = `<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 2026</p>
<h2>1. Acceptance and Age Requirement</h2><p>By using Yat Dice you accept these terms and the <a href="/privacy?lang=en">Privacy Policy</a>. You must be at least 13 years old to use the service.</p>
<h2>2. License</h2><p>You are granted a personal, non-transferable and revocable license to use the game for personal, non-commercial purposes. You may not copy, reverse engineer or modify the game to cheat.</p>
<h2>3. Your Account</h2><p>You are responsible for keeping your account secure. Impersonating others or using someone else's account is prohibited.</p>
<h2>4. Community Rules: Zero Tolerance</h2><p>Insults, profanity, hate speech, harassment, threats, sexual content, spam, inappropriate profile photos or usernames, and cheating are strictly prohibited. Players can report and block others. Reports are reviewed; violating content is removed and accounts may be permanently closed.</p>
<h2>5. Virtual Items</h2><p>Coins, cases and dice are virtual in-game items only. They cannot be bought with real money, cannot be converted into money or anything of value, and cannot be transferred. They are lost when an account is deleted or closed.</p>
<h2>6. Case Odds</h2><p>Each case gives between 50 and 199 virtual coins, and every amount is equally likely: 50–99 33.3%, 100–149 33.3%, 150–199 33.4%.</p>
<h2>7. Service Availability</h2><p>The service is provided as is; uninterrupted operation is not guaranteed. If you lose connection and do not return to a match within 60 seconds, you may lose the match by forfeit. To the extent permitted by applicable law, we are not liable for indirect damages; any mandatory consumer rights you have are not affected.</p>
<h2>8. App Stores</h2><p>These terms are between you and the developer. Apple and Google are not responsible for the service, its content, maintenance or support; however, Apple and its subsidiaries are third-party beneficiaries of these terms for apps downloaded from the App Store.</p>
<h2>9. Termination and Changes</h2><p>You can delete your account at any time. Accounts that break these terms may be closed. If the terms change, the new version will be published on this page.</p>
<h2>10. Contact</h2><p>{{CONTACT}}</p>`

